  "title": "Skillet Burgers with Tomato Sauce",
  "description": "Simmered on the stove with spiced tomato sauce, onions, and lemons, these barbecue skillet burgers are a nice change from the standard grilled burger.",
  "authors": [
    "Renee Sellers"
  ],
